1
00:00:00,581 --> 00:00:03,697
So we got that list of goals here

2
00:00:07,218 --> 00:00:09,121
and we can add and remove goals.

3
00:00:10,021 --> 00:00:13,444
Now, one thing we might want to add here

4
00:00:14,119 --> 00:00:15,517
is a mechanism to

5
00:00:16,127 --> 00:00:19,582
ask the user if they really wanna delete a

6
00:00:19,582 --> 00:00:22,331
goal before going ahead and deleting it.

7
00:00:22,572 --> 00:00:24,485
Because right now, if I click remove, the

8
00:00:24,501 --> 00:00:27,287
goal is removed instantly. There is no time

9
00:00:27,402 --> 00:00:27,581
to

10
00:00:28,299 --> 00:00:29,914
revisit that decision and maybe change it.

11
00:00:32,229 --> 00:00:34,010
And since this is a pretty common

12
00:00:34,091 --> 00:00:36,562
requirement, HTMX has got you covered.

13
00:00:37,541 --> 00:00:40,236
You can add the hx-confirm

14
00:00:40,894 --> 00:00:44,264
attribute on an element or on a parent

15
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:46,061
element due to inheritance.

16
00:00:46,832 --> 00:00:49,752
And when that element or some child element

17
00:00:49,880 --> 00:00:53,892
then sends a request or is about to send a

18
00:00:53,908 --> 00:00:54,470
request,

19
00:00:55,096 --> 00:01:00,407
hx-confirm will show a confirmation popup

20
00:00:58,546 --> 00:01:01,886
question and only if the user confirms it,

21
00:01:02,175 --> 00:01:04,375
so if the user clicks yes or okay,

22
00:01:05,050 --> 00:01:07,604
only then is the request actually sent.

23
00:01:09,001 --> 00:01:11,715
And we specify the message we wanna show to

24
00:01:11,715 --> 00:01:12,486
the user here

25
00:01:13,321 --> 00:01:15,746
as a value for hx-confirm.

26
00:01:17,015 --> 00:01:19,585
And as mentioned, we can add that on the

27
00:01:19,585 --> 00:01:21,560
element that sends the request or

28
00:01:22,090 --> 00:01:24,547
due to inheritance also on some parent

29
00:01:24,644 --> 00:01:24,917
element.

30
00:01:25,465 --> 00:01:27,773
For example, here on the unordered list

31
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,395
so that there I don't just have hx-swap but

32
00:01:33,605 --> 00:01:34,853
also hx-confirm.

33
00:01:36,822 --> 00:01:39,060
And with that done, if we save that and

34
00:01:39,221 --> 00:01:39,624
reload,

35
00:01:40,542 --> 00:01:42,377
if I add a goal and I click remove,

36
00:01:42,941 --> 00:01:43,215
this

37
00:01:43,810 --> 00:01:47,499
confirmation popup box here opens up first.

38
00:01:48,021 --> 00:01:49,457
And if I click cancel here,

39
00:01:50,142 --> 00:01:52,998
then nothing happens. No request is sent.

40
00:01:54,464 --> 00:01:55,639
Only if I click OK,

41
00:01:56,170 --> 00:01:59,471
only then goes HTMX ahead and sends that

42
00:01:59,471 --> 00:02:01,811
request, in this case, this DELETE request.

43
00:02:03,009 --> 00:02:05,131
And of course, Ajax confirm does not just

44
00:02:05,131 --> 00:02:07,431
work with DELETE requests but with all

45
00:02:08,030 --> 00:02:09,245
HTMX requests.
